      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bonso bakadisangisha bu muntu umue mu muaba mubaluluke wakadi ku mpala kua tshibi tshia ku luseke lua mai; bakambila Ezela mufundi ne, Ulue ne mukanda wa mikenji ya Mose yakambila Yehowa Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezela muakuidi wakalua ne mukanda wa mikenji ku mesu kua bantu bakadi badisangishaku ne balume ne bakashi ne bonso bakadi ne matshu a kunvua mu dituku dia kumudilu dia ngondo wa muanda mutekete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakaubala mu muaba mubaluluke wakadi ku mpala kua tshibi tshia ku luseke lua mai, ku dinda tô ne ku munda munya, ku mpala kua balume ne bakashi ne kua bonso bakadi ne matshu a kunvua; bantu bonso bakateleja matshu abo ku mei a mu mukanda wa mikenji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezela mufundi wakimana ha tshiambidilu tshia mabaya tshiakalongololabo bua bualu ebu; Matitiya ne Shema ne Anaya ne Uliya ne Hilekiya ne Mâseya bakimana ku tshianza tshiandi tshia balume; Pedaya ne Mishaele ne Malekiya ne Hashuma ne Hashebadana ne Zekâya ne Meshulama bakimana ku tshianza tshiandi tshia bakashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezela wakavungulula mukanda ku mesu kua bantu, bualu bua yeye wakadi ku muaba wakadi kulu kua bonso; hakavungululeye mukanda, bantu bonso bakimana kulu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezela wakavudishila Yehowa Nzambi munene disanka. Bantu bonso bakamuitaba ne, Amen, Amen, bele maboko abo mulu; bakinyika mitu yabo, bakatendelela Yehowa ne mesu abo minangile hanshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeshua ne Bani ne Shelebaya ne Yamina ne Akuba ne Shabetai ne Hodaya ne Mâseya ne Kelita ne Azaya ne Yozabada ne Hanana ne Pelaya ne Bena Lewi bakajingulula bantu mikenji; bantu bonso bakimana mu muaba wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakadi babala mu mukanda, mu mikenji ya Nzambi, bakajingulula biakane; bakayijinguluila bantu kabidi, nunku buonso buabo bakunvua biakane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nehemiya gouverneur wakadi ne Ezela muakuidi ne mufundi ne Bena Lewi, bakadi bayisha bantu, bakambila bantu bonso ne, Dituku edi didi dia tshijila kudi Yehowa Nzambi wenu, kanujingi, kanutedi mua dî. Bualu bua bantu bonso bakadi badila hakunvuabo mei a mu mikenji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakabambila ne, Yai bienu kuenu, nudie bintu bia manyi, mume bintu bidi bishemakane, nutumine bantu badi hatuhu bintu bia kudia; bualu bua edi ndituku dia tshijila kudi Mukelenge wetu; kanunyingalashi mitshima yenu, bualu bua disanka dia Yehowa mbukole buenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Bena Lewi bakahuwisha bantu bonso ne, Nuikale talalâ, bualu bua edi ndituku dia tshijila, kanunyingalashi mitshima yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bantu bonso bakaya kuabo bua kudiabo ne bua kunuabo ne bua kutuminabo bantu bakadi hatuhu bintu bia kudia ne bua kusankabo, bualu bua bobo bakajingulula mei akabambilabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku dibidi bakadi ku mutu kua biota bia bantu bonso ne bakuidi ne Bena Lewi bakadisangisha kudi Ezela mufundi bua kunvuabo mei a mikenji mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakasangana bualu mu mukanda wa mikenji buakambila Yehowa Mose bua Bena Isalele bashikame mu bitandatanda, badie bidia bia disanka mu ngondo wa muanda mutekete; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bua bobo batumine bantu bonso mu misoko yonso ne mu Yelushalema ne, Yai bienu ku mikuna, nuangate matamba a olive ne matamba a olive ya muitu, ne matamba a mitshi ya myrte ne malala a mabue, ne matamba a mitshi mikuabo bua kuenza nʼau bitandatanda bu muakafundabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku bantu bakaya, bakalua nʼau, bakadienzela bitandatanda, muntu ne muntu ha mutu ha nsubu wandi ne mu mpangu yabo ne mu mpangu ya ku nsubu wa Nzambi ne mu muaba mubaluluke wakadi ku mpala kua tshibi tshia ku luseke lua mai ne mu muaba mubaluluke wakadi ku mpala kua tshibi tshia Efelayima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bantu bonso bakadi bafume mu buhika bakenza bitandatanda, bakashikama mu bitandatanda; bualu bua Bena Isalele kabakanza kuenza nunku ku matuku a Yoshua, muana wa Nuna, tô ne ku dituku edi. Bakadi ne disanka dinene be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakabala mu mukanda wa mikenji ya Nzambi ku dituku ku dituku, ku dituku dia kumudilu tô ne ku dituku dia nshikidilu. Bakadia bidia bia disanka matuku muanda mutekete; dituku dia muanda mukulu diakadi dituku dinene dia disangisha, bu muakadi mukenji mujadike.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
